---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import RecruitCta from '../components/RecruitCta.astro';
---
<Base
  title="For Tutors — Free Profile and Local Tuition Leads | ApnaTutor"
  description="Apne area ke students tak pohanchein. Free profile banayein, verification badges lein, aur apne subjects ki tuition requests seedha dashboard mein dekhein."
  path="/for-tutors"
>
  <Prose
    title="Tutors ke liye"
    lead="Apne ilaqay ke parents tak pohanchne ka seedha rasta — bina kisi commission ke."
  >
    <section>
      <h2>Aapko kya milta hai</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Apna profile page</strong> — Google par search hone wala, apne naam aur area ke saath.</li>
        <li><strong>Tuition leads</strong> — aapke area aur subjects ki requests seedha dashboard mein.</li>
        <li><strong>Verification badges</strong> — parents ka bharosa jeetne ka sabse tez tareeqa.</li>
        <li><strong>Koi commission nahi.</strong> Fee aap parent se seedha lete hain, hum beech mein nahi aate.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Profile banane ka tareeqa</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Account banayein aur email verify karein.</li>
        <li>Profile form bharein — subjects, classes, boards, areas, fee range, availability. 10 minute lagte hain, aur beech mein chhor kar baad mein wapas aa sakte hain.</li>
        <li>Apna phone number dein. <strong>Ye number public nahi hota</strong> — sirf un parents ko nazar aata hai jo login karke aapka contact kholte hain.</li>
        <li>Submit karein. Hum 24–48 ghante mein review karke WhatsApp par bata dete hain.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Verification — kya hota hai</h2>
      <p>Teen alag checks hain, aur har ek ka apna badge:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Phone verified</strong> — hum aapke number par rabta karte hain.</li>
        <li><strong>Identity checked</strong> — hum WhatsApp par aapka shanakhti card dekhte hain, naam match karte hain, aur <strong>message delete kar dete hain</strong>. Copy hum nahi rakhte.</li>
        <li><strong>Qualification checked</strong> — degree ya certificate isi tarah.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Teeno complete hon to profile par "ApnaTutor Verified" aa jata hai. Verified profiles ko parents ka jawab kaafi zyada milta hai.</p>
      <p><strong>Badges aap khud set nahi kar sakte</strong> — ye sirf ApnaTutor team set karti hai. Agar tutors khud apne badge laga sakte to badge ka koi matlab hi na rehta.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Leads ka tareeqa</h2>
      <p>Jab koi parent aapke area aur subject ki request post karta hai, wo aapke dashboard mein aa jati hai. Usme class, subject, area, mode, budget aur timing hoti hai — <strong>parent ka number us mein nahi hota</strong>.</p>
      <p>Aap "I'm Interested" karein to parent ko pata chal jata hai. Phir parent faisla karta hai ke kisse rabta karna hai. Ye parents ki privacy ke liye hai, aur isi wajah se log yahan apni requirement post karte hain.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Kya kharch hai</h2>
      <p>Abhi kuch nahi. Profile, verification aur leads sab free hain.</p>
      <p>Aage chal kar "Featured" placement paid hogi — yani aapki profile apne area ke results mein upar aayegi. Wo optional rahegi, aur uspar saaf "Featured" likha hoga. Basic profile aur leads free rahenge.</p>
    </section>
  </Prose>

  <RecruitCta />
</Base>
